# WPG (spec/e2e-capture-modes-plan.md, FR-AST-3): bundled assets are fetched and verified by the
# fetchBundledAssets Gradle task (buildSrc/FetchBundledAssetsTask.kt) from bundled-assets.json —
# that manifest is the source-controlled fact; these hundreds of megabytes of binaries, and the
# generated manifest.json describing what actually landed here, are not.
#
# P24 fix (register, Wave G batch gate, FR-AST-13, AC-190): this now lives under the `full`
# flavor's OWN source set, `app/src/full/assets/bundled/`, not the shared `app/src/main/` every
# flavor inherits — moving it out of `src/main/` is what makes `play` structurally incapable of
# packaging these assets (constitution VII). See buildSrc's `BundledAssetPackaging` object for the
# full account. The old path is also still ignored below in case a pre-fix checkout left it behind
# (the build's own `cleanupLegacyBundledAssets` task deletes it, but a plain `git status` should
# never show it as untracked either).
/app/src/full/assets/bundled/
/app/src/main/assets/bundled/

# R-1001 (register): sherpa-onnx's Android native libraries are fetched and verified by the
# fetchSherpaNativeLibraries Gradle task (buildSrc/FetchSherpaNativeTask.kt) from the root
# sherpa-native.json — that manifest is the source-controlled fact; the extracted .so files are
# not, same rule as app/src/main/assets/bundled/ above.
/app/src/main/jniLibs/

# Local capture evidence the register rows cite by path; never committed (constitution VIII:
# only a full canonical tour replaces results/ui-audit/).
scratchpad/
